libcroco is discontinued in this librsvg tree
=============================================

This directory is an **unbuilt archive**. It is not compiled, not
linked, not optional, and not packaged. The only CSS engine is `css/`
(`css/rsvg-css-engine.c`).

Last vendored version: **0.6.15** (GNOME 0.6.13 plus in-tree CVE
fixes: CVE-2017-8834, CVE-2017-8871, CVE-2020-12825). 0.6.13 already
had CVE-2017-7960 and CVE-2017-7961. SONAME was `libcroco-0.6.so.3`.

`RSVG_CSS_ENGINE=croco` is ignored. `--enable-croco` /
`--disable-croco` are errors.

To use this copy elsewhere, take the `libcroco/` directory. Do not
`PKG_CHECK_MODULES` a system libcroco into librsvg.
